{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、渡辺です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/03/02/4573725/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とあるロケをしてきまして、\n体がバッキバキです\n全身が痛い、全身の筋肉やら骨という骨が\n泣いて叫んでおります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉に入りたい、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/03/02/4573725/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"従妹が高校受験で、今日が発表なんですけど\n疲れはてちゃったみたいで\nみり愛にこんな可愛いメールを送ってきたんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「もう嫌だ！私生まれ変わるならうさぎに\nなりたい」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛すぎませんか。\nだから私は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「そうだよね、、。でもみり愛は布団になりたい！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？おかしい？え？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら咄嗟に従妹から返信がきて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「それは意味がわからない」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と2個下の女の子に冷静に突っ込まれました\n皆様は、生まれ変わるなら何になりたいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日の朝、連絡がきました\n無事受かったそうです、おめでとう(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月誕生日の方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/03/02/4573725/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/03/02/4573725/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奈々未さん、万理華さん、高山さん\nみなみさん、ちはるさん、蓮加ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅れましたが、おめでとうございます〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月生まれの方は教えてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/03/02/4573725/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4日は幕張メッセで握手会です！\n楽しみにお待ちしております〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}